@startuml 01-context
!theme plain
title Context — Weather Activity Ranking Service

actor Client
rectangle "Activity Ranking Service\n(Node.js / TypeScript)" as App
cloud "Open-Meteo\n(forecast + geocoding)" as OM
database "PostgreSQL" as PG

Client --> App : GraphQL (POST /graphql)\nHealth (GET /health)
App --> PG : read / upsert forecasts &\ngeocode cache
App --> OM : refresh + cold-start only\n(retry / circuit breaker)

note right of App
  Hot path reads Postgres only.
  Open-Meteo is not on the
  critical path for warm locations.
end note

@enduml
